### Summary of semantics

- Return code `-2` from `copy_path` means "user declined" — no error message is printed, but `any_failure` is set (contributing exit status 1) and the loop continues to the next source.
- The prompt fires only when the destination actually resolves (exists as a regular file via `stat`) and `-i` is active. It fires before any `open`/`unlink`, so it covers both the normal overwrite path and the force-replace path.
